            3575
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " `right` steps modulo `left + right`, such that only one temporary is needed. Eventually, we",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            3576,
            3671
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " arrive back at `mid - left`. However, if `gcd(left + right, right)` is not 1, the above steps",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            3672,
            3769
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " skipped over elements. For example:",
